 Bolster Early Learning</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Alignment</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/2022-01/First%2010%20Draft%20of%20Alignment%20Guidebook%20Components.9-15-21.pdf\">Alignment Guidebook</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://learnwithmoose.maine.gov/module/1344/early-learning-foundational-skills-module-parents-and-caregivers/overview\">MOOSE Foundational Skills Progression</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.cambridgema.gov/News/2015/11/~/media/F8450DA771B342529B5FF721684CAF21.ashx\" target=\"_blank\">Starting Early: Addressing the Achievement Gap</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://learnwithmoose.maine.gov/\">Learn with MOOSE!</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://earlylearningnetwork.unl.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/MDRC-Alignment-Policy-Brief-2019.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Pre-K to Grade 3 Alignment</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Literacy Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://lincs.ed.gov/publications/pdf/PRFbooklet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Put Reading First – Helping Your Child Learn to Read (2006)</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.famlit.org/\" target=\"_blank\">National Center for Family Literacy</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>